  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 15 October 2024, the use of 84 Vicarage Farm Road TW5 0AE as two self-contained flats was lawful within the meaning of Section 191 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 for the following reason:\nThe applicant has submitted sufficient evidence to demonstrate, on the balance of probability, the continued use of the property as two self-contained flats for a period of four years prior to the submission of the application."
